      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "VRChat uses the ram because it needs it to operate. Limiting its ram would just result in it running out and crashing sooner.\n\nThe vram performance stat that's being introduced should result in a lot of egregious-memory-hog avatars being blocked by default. It should (hopefully) help with the crashes.",
